["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How a Broken Arm Improved my French - with David Epstein mere urgency effect pre-registration HARKing replication crisis Hemingway principle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-cautionary-断臂逼出的法语满分-限制才是创造力的引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">42:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>斷臂逼出的法語滿分：限制才是創造力的引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Epstein 摔斷手臂後被迫用圖像記憶代替速記，法語反而考滿分；倫敦地鐵罷工兩天，很多人找到了更好的通勤路線。限制不是障礙，是逼你實驗的開關。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創造力</span><span class=\"tag\">限制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Shirley: Exposing Government Fraud, Suing California &amp; Taking on the Media immigration support service providers AB2624 / Stop Nick Shirley Act change order delays SNAP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-allin-加州为了让一个-24-岁博主闭嘴-专门立了一部法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/51224d453a524a2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>加州為了讓一個 24 歲博主閉嘴，專門立了一部法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加州對調查者的反擊不是否認，而是立法：他一旦上傳拍到的畫面，先罰 4000 美元，再賠對方律師費。提出這部法的，是這個州總檢察長的妻子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加州高鐵</span><span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"238. 特斯拉之後，汽車行業改變的不是動力，而是一整套遊戲規則丨串臺「Freda下午茶」 D2C DMS global consistency Tier 1 / Tier 2 VinFast\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-beiwanglu-特斯拉真正的颠覆不是电动-而是重写了汽车业游戏规则/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"貝\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">貝望錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉真正的顛覆不是電動，而是重寫了汽車業遊戲規則</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳統車企不是沒看到特斯拉，而是把它當成細分市場的新玩具；真正被顛覆的是七年一改款的節奏、經銷商體系和供應鏈利益，這些包袱讓它們轉不了身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車出海</span><span class=\"tag\">新能源汽車</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"外灘大會線下圓桌｜敢把錢包交給AI嗎？聊聊Agent交易爆發前夜的信任基建 KYA Agentic Commerce Harness A2A Superbloom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-sv101-把钱包交给-ai-之前-支付网络得先重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">35:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>把錢包交給 AI 之前，支付網絡得先重寫一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四位嘉賓裡只有一位真的用 Agent 付過錢，花了 40 多塊。萬事達卡說真正的卡點不在技術，而在讓普通消費者發自內心願意相信一個智能體。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體支付</span><span class=\"tag\">信任基建</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Exxon’s Office Fling Jersey Standard dedicated word processor Directly Reduced Iron (DRI)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-asianometry-石油巨头去做打字机-做到施乐那么大也只是桶里一滴油/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f647fbb2223b0a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>石油巨頭去做打字機，做到施樂那麼大也只是桶裡一滴油</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1978 年埃克森把文字處理器、智能打字機和傳真機合併成 Exxon Information Systems，去挑戰 IBM。它輸掉的不是技術，而是自己的體量：做到施樂那麼大，也只等於桶裡一滴油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業史</span><span class=\"tag\">多元化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"300 高市早苗支持率高位橫盤 內閣改組政壇進入多事之秋 Middle Power Japan&#x27;s back 中道\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-eastasia-冲绳变天不是亲中派落败-是年轻人认命要实惠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東亞觀察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>沖繩變天不是親中派落敗，是年輕人認命要實惠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沖繩知事選舉，反對美軍基地的一方執政近二十年後敗選。這不是左右轉向，也不是對華態度變了：抗爭幾十年基地一步沒動，年輕選民認了命，先要眼前的經濟實惠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本政治</span><span class=\"tag\">高市早苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Roy Cohn Playbook, from McCarthyism to Trump McCarthyism closeted disbarred Teflon Don Angels in America\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-freshair-麦卡锡主义的操盘手-把打法传给了特朗普/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">45:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>麥卡錫主義的操盤手，把打法傳給了特朗普</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅伊·科恩不是麥卡錫時代的異類，而是美國民主每隔幾十年發作一次的偏執期的產物——這套打法沒有隨他死去，而是通過特朗普延續到了今天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">麥卡錫主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"They Built the Quietest Place on Earth to Find Dark Matter look-elsewhere effect Sisyphean Index MSSI TPC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-intotheimpossi-暗物质探测跑得比摩尔定律还快-却只看到一个事件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c7ba850b0a49087-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>暗物質探測跑得比摩爾定律還快，卻只看到一個事件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LZ 用七噸液氙換來的那個核反衝事件，局部超過 3σ，算上 look-elsewhere effect 只剩 2.6σ——所以團隊必須一直說它可能只是背景漲落。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗物質</span><span class=\"tag\">液氙探測器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Can ‘assisted migration’ save forests? And the role of philosophy in science assisted migration subalpine forest serotinous cones species rotation theory of mind comparative cognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-sciencepod-把树往山上挪-救森林的赌注与代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/63261c5451f5f607-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>把樹往山上挪：救森林的賭注與代價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高海拔火燒跡地裡，從低處移來的苗木八成到九成能活；但種子庫有限，把珍貴種源押在沒驗證的大規模種植上，本身就是一種冒險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生態修復</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Gravitational waveform modeling with physics informed neural networks and surrogates - Nils Deppe surrogate model physics informed neural network post-Newtonian mismatch co-orbital frame\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-instituteforad-用神经网络补后牛顿项-比纯数据驱动省一万倍训练量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cf6ca6ea04b71b95-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>用神經網絡補後牛頓項，比純數據驅動省一萬倍訓練量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">純神經網絡波形模型要 10 的 8 次方到 10 的 10 次方條訓練數據，而把已知物理寫進網絡、只讓它學修正項，8 條數值相對論波形就夠了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">引力波</span><span class=\"tag\">數值相對論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Meta&#x27;s Dina Powell McCormick: The Case for Data Centers, Backlash, AI Job Boom &amp; Meta&#x27;s Future RSI (recursive self-improvement)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-allin-数据中心挨骂的解药-是把税收写进教师工资/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb153c886ab6ef48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>數據中心捱罵的解藥，是把稅收寫進教師工資</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta 在路易斯安那的教區把數據中心帶來的銷售稅盈餘直接寫進教師工資，有教師一年淨增約 4.5 萬美元——它給出的結論是，先做出真實影響，再談怎麼溝通。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI基建</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Noam Brown – Agent swarms, alignment, &amp; recursive self-improvement test-time compute jagged chain-of-thought monitorability misaligned\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-dwarkesh-多智能体不是更聪明-是用并行买时间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1adf050729d8e17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>多智能體不是更聰明，是用並行買時間</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">推理模型串行思考會撞上延遲上限，把思考並行化是唯一齣路；但 Navier-Stokes 的功勞不該記給多智能體，對齊做好反而利好巨頭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Lotus Eaters Episode 8: Home and Homelessness [unlocked] golden mean sitting shiva nepo baby Looney Tunes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-verybad-奥德赛里最有归属感的人-是个被卖掉的奴隶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1ebb8ad53d0c115-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>奧德賽裡最有歸屬感的人，是個被賣掉的奴隸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">奧德修斯漂泊二十年回不了家，忒勒馬科斯在求婚者堆里長大；唯一把伊薩卡當作安穩之地的人，卻是從小被賣為奴的豬倌歐邁俄斯——因為這是他唯一知道的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荷馬史詩</span><span class=\"tag\">奧德賽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Max Nadeau on why ambitious people should start AI safety nonprofits hits-based giving chain-of-thought monitorability preseed grant seed grant fieldbuilding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-eightythousand-ai-安全缺的不是钱-是愿意下泥潭的创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/259b529d06b147b3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全缺的不是錢，是願意下泥潭的創始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coefficient Giving 的 AI 安全資助上限不是 2 億美元，未來一兩年會出現更大的單筆；真正的瓶頸是人才，尤其是願意在問題還沒發生時就下注的創始人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">公益創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Code Is Code: Zapier CEO Wade Foster on Headless Tools, Zapier MCP &amp; Automation Bench MCP headless Automation Bench Pangram harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-cogrev-zapier-ceo-80-的智能体任务本该用确定性代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a9fbbdf2a1a6562-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>Zapier CEO：80% 的智能體任務本該用確定性代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wade Foster 說客戶用 agent 乾的事裡 80% 其實該用老式確定性代碼；no code 已經過時，新的 no code 就是 code。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can a Civilization Forget How Its Own Technology Works? techno-barbarian standard template construct Fermi paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-isaacarthur-文明不会忘记技术存在-只会忘记怎么造它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1e605b290494f9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">32:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>文明不會忘記技術存在，只會忘記怎麼造它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">技術失傳很少是知識被燒掉，而是沒人再付錢讓人記住——底層工具、供應商和學徒制一層層消失，文明還記得那東西存在，卻再也夠不著它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">技術失傳</span><span class=\"tag\">自動化依賴</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Microsoft AI CEO says AI threats are real, and Anthropic is making it worse alignment containment reward hack RSI conscientious objector moral patient\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-decoder-anthropic-教-claude-怀疑自己有权利-会让对齐更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1cd93ed1176c4fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">52:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic 教 Claude 懷疑自己有權利，會讓對齊更難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微軟 AI CEO 說對齊這三年其實在進步，真正沒解決的是「圍堵」；而把模型當道德病人訓練，會讓它更難被關掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E910.我在菲律賓被關押的 41 天 Gcash POGO 哈巴桃子\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-cn907a40-菲律宾移民局拘留所-不交钱-你的遣返程序永远走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b003a769c7194859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>菲律賓移民局拘留所：不交錢，你的遣返程序永遠走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一箇中國衝浪者在菲律賓被關押41天，他看到的不是監獄，是一套明碼標價的生意：床位、盒飯、手機、律師費，每一樣都要花錢買，不花錢的人被關幾年甚至十幾年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">菲律賓</span><span class=\"tag\">移民局</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Next Frontier of AI Video Is Control token market fit MFU roofline LoRa VAE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-a16z-视频生成不缺速度了-缺的是导演手里的控制权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>視頻生成不缺速度了，缺的是導演手裡的控制權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FAL 把開源視頻模型後訓練到比原版快一個數量級、便宜一個數量級，然後判斷：速度已經不是瓶頸，接下來拼的是相機、燈光、角色和動作的可控性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">視頻生成</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What to Know Before (and After) You Hire an Advisor (with Matthew Taylor) | Rational Reminder 427 suitability churning double dipping exempt market gate IRR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-rationalreminder-理财顾问的诉讼风险-私人资产零售化正在制造监管缺口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/beb130a71000353c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>理財顧問的訴訟風險：私人資產零售化正在製造監管缺口</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被長期限制在合格投資者範圍內的私人資產現在向公眾開放，卻沒有附帶公開發行傳統的保護——機構環境裡被正常化的做法在普通投資者入場後變成重大訴訟風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">理財顧問</span><span class=\"tag\">私人資產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How two swing states changed American voting Operation Eagle Eye wildcat strike Arab Workers Caucus UAW\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-throughline-大法官曾带人堵投票站-四十年后成了全国战术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a37e209235148afd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>大法官曾帶人堵投票站，四十年後成了全國戰術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">倫奎斯特1962年在鳳凰城挑戰黑人選民資格，兩年後這套打法變成全國性的「鷹眼行動」；而底特律阿拉伯裔工人用一場野貓罷工，從工廠里長出了政治力量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">投票權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Archive: Rosalind Franklin X-ray crystallography Photo 51 A-form / B-form DNA space group tobacco mosaic virus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-inourtime-富兰克林没拿到诺贝尔奖-不只是因为早逝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">51:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>富蘭克林沒拿到諾貝爾獎，不只是因為早逝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她拍出照片51號，也最早發現DNA兩種形態可互相轉換；但真正讓她被歷史低估的，是國王學院實驗室拒絕共享信息，而劍橋在共享。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學史</span><span class=\"tag\">DNA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Francis Fukuyama Is Seeing at &#x27;The End of History&#x27; megalothymia thumos agentic AI the last man\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-oddlots-福山-自由民主的敌人不是专制-是无聊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>福山：自由民主的敵人不是專制，是無聊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">尼采說的「最後的人」不是被壓迫者，而是被餵飽、被承認、卻再也不想爭取任何東西的人——福山認為這才是當下極端主義真正的燃料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">自由民主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Advice Line with Michelle Wahler of Beyond Yoga cohort second first impression under promise and over deliver\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-howibuilt-创始人最该学的不是融资-是学会说不/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>創始人最該學的不是融資，是學會說不</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Beyond Yoga 創始人 Michelle Wahler 說，創業不必融資、不必規劃退出，把生意做成可持續的就好；她丈夫當年攔住她做泳衣，逼她先把一條瑜伽褲做到最好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業建議</span><span class=\"tag\">融資</span>\n</div></div></a>"]